{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-199660-r4511952","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Honey Lime Pork Loin","sourcePageId":199660,"sourceRevision":"4511952","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-18T02:17:15Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Honey%20Lime%20Pork%20Loin&oldid=4511952","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:05:25.425Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using cayenne","Category:Recipes using chicken broth and stock","Category:Recipes using honey","Category:Recipes using lime juice","Category:Recipes using pork","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Roasted recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"70d7360203b5933a780e9fb8dcc2322abb958a420438cf8c731190a67b657777","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Pork recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 1 boneless [[Cookbook:Pork|pork]] loin roast\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Garlic Powder|garlic powder]]\n* 1 tsp salt\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Chicken Broth|chicken broth]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Red Wine|red wine]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Worcestershire Sauce|Worcestershire sauce]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Lime|lime]], juiced\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:All-purpose flour|all-purpose flour]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Heat oil in a large [[Cookbook:Sauté Pan|sauté pan]] over high heat. Add roast and cook until thoroughly browned on all sides.\n#Remove from pan and keep warm. Add broth and [[Cookbook:Deglazing|deglaze]] pan, stirring to remove browned bits.\n#Place roast in a greased roasting pan and rub with seasonings.\n#Reduce chicken broth by half.\n#Combine chicken broth with wine and Worcestershire sauce and pour over pork.\n#Insert an oven-safe probe [[Cookbook:Thermometer|thermometer]] in the roast and [[Cookbook:Baking|bake]] at 275°F (135°C) until internal temperature reaches 145°F (63°C). Keep warm.\n#Place cooking liquid in the refrigerator until fat has solidified. Remove and discard fat.\n#Stir in honey and lime juice. Set aside.\n#Melt butter over medium heat in a large [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]]. [[Cookbook:Whisk|Whisk]] in flour and cook, stirring constantly until light blonde color is achieved.\n#Add cooking liquid mixture to the pan and [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] until reduced by ⅓.\n#Rewarm pork, if needed. [[Cookbook:Slicing|Slice]] and serve with sauce.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using pork]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lime juice]]\n[[Category:Roasted recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken broth and stock]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Honey Lime Pork Loin","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 boneless pork loin roast","sourceText":"1 boneless pork loin roast","amountText":"1 boneless pork loin roast","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tsp cayenne pepper","sourceText":"1 tsp cayenne pepper","amountText":"1 tsp cayenne pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 tbsp brown sugar","sourceText":"2 tbsp brown sugar","amountText":"2 tbsp brown sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tsp garlic powder","sourceText":"1 tsp garlic powder","amountText":"1 tsp garlic powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tsp salt","sourceText":"1 tsp salt","amountText":"1 tsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 tsp black pepper","sourceText":"1 tsp black pepper","amountText":"1 tsp black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 cup chicken broth","sourceText":"1 cup chicken broth","amountText":"1 cup chicken broth","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"¼ cup red wine","sourceText":"¼ cup red wine","amountText":"¼ cup red wine","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"2 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","sourceText":"2 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","amountText":"2 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"2 tbsp olive oil","sourceText":"2 tbsp olive oil","amountText":"2 tbsp olive oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-11","name":"2 tbsp honey","sourceText":"2 tbsp honey","amountText":"2 tbsp 